# Local phone partition backups and extracted artifacts
xiaomi4-cancro-backup-*/
*.img
*.bin
*.elf
*.dtb
*.dtbo
*.cpio
*.cpio.gz
# ...except the root volume, which is an ARTIFACT this repository OWNS and must carry: the HFS+ root
# arm's whole safety claim is that a FAILED HFS mount falls through to mockfs, and a build that
# silently embedded nothing would make the fall-through the only path, so the bytes are committed
# rather than generated into the ignored `out/`. `src/entry/blob/xnu_arm_entry_root_hfs.S` states
# this and `tools/check_hfs_root_blob.py` (in `make check`) re-derives the fields a stale blob would
# get wrong - the claim in that file and the rule here disagreed until now, and nothing refused.
!src/entry/blob/*.img

# External source checkouts (large, reproducible)
external/

# Generated build/output directories
out/
build/
dist/

# Host/editor noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
__pycache__/
